{{if .PublicIdentity}}## The key to this archive

`{{.PublicIdentityFile}}` on this disc holds the key. If that file is unreadable,
this is the same key, and so is the one in `MANIFEST.txt`:

```
{{.PublicIdentity}}
```

It is 74 characters and carries its own checksum, so a copy retyped by hand is
either right or rejected outright — `age` will not accept a near miss and
silently produce rubbish. Save it to a file and use `age -d -i thatfile`.

